\s15\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20 {\cs16\super +}{ MAIN:004}}}{\f1  }{\cs16\f1\super K{\footnote \pard\plain \s15\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20 {\cs16\super K}{ Cube Basics}}}{\f1  }{\b\f1\fs24\cf2 Cube Basics}{\f1 
